G2D licensing
=============

Copyright 2026 The G2D authors.

The project's own work is released under two licences. Every source file names its licence on one of its first
lines as an SPDX identifier (https://spdx.org/licenses/); the full texts are in LICENSES/.

  Hardware descriptions                SPDX: Apache-2.0 WITH SHL-2.1
    SystemVerilog RTL, testbench and   Solderpad Hardware License v2.1           LICENSES/SHL-2.1.txt
    integration RTL, timing            (a wraparound of the Apache License 2.0)   LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
    constraints (*.sv, *.svh, *.sdc,
    *.xdc)

  Everything else                      SPDX: Apache-2.0
    C / C++ / Python / shell / Tcl /   Apache License 2.0                         LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
    build files, golden model, driver,
    scripts, tests, specifications and
    documentation

The Solderpad Hardware License v2.1 is listed by SPDX as an exception to the Apache License 2.0, hence the
expression "Apache-2.0 WITH SHL-2.1". Recipients may, at their option, treat hardware files as released under the
Apache License 2.0 alone (LICENSES/SHL-2.1.txt).

Dual-licensed paths of the project's own work (so that the Linux kernel can use them):

  sw/linux/                            GPL-2.0-only OR MIT
                                       Linux kernel driver, uapi header, Kbuild (the module uses GPL-only kernel
                                       symbols; MODULE_LICENSE("Dual MIT/GPL"))
  sw/linux/bindings/                   GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause (the kernel's rule for devicetree bindings)
  sw/include/generated/g2d_regs.h      Apache-2.0 OR MIT (generated register header, included by the kernel driver)

Third-party material keeps its own licence (details in THIRD_PARTY.md):

  sw/apps/doom/                        GPL-2.0-or-later (links with doomgeneric)
  sw/include/vg_lite.h                 MIT (the public VGLite API header; its own copyright notice)
  fpga/cheshire/axi_vga_g2d/           SHL-0.51 (its own LICENSE file; also LICENSES/SHL-0.51.txt)
  fpga/cheshire/cheshire-g2d.patch     changes to Cheshire, under Cheshire's licence (SHL-0.51)

Licence texts in LICENSES/: Apache-2.0, SHL-2.1, SHL-0.51, MIT, BSD-2-Clause, GPL-2.0-only, GPL-2.0-or-later.

Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, the material in this repository is distributed on an
"AS IS" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied. See the licence texts for
the specific language governing permissions and limitations.
